flowchart LR
  order[Shopify: order placed] --> make[Make scenario]
  fulfilled[Shopify: fulfillment with tracking] --> make
  returned[Shopify: return received / inspected] --> make
  make --> normalize[Normalize event + stable event ID]
  normalize --> router[Make Router: order.placed / order.shipped / return.received]
  router --> api[POST /webhooks/make]
  api --> validate[Validate + compose matching template]
  validate --> email[Connected email provider sends update]
  email --> customer[Customer receives store update]
